<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1000)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>When your license ends, ask for more.</b> The lock screen says so and offers <b>Request an Extension&#8230;</b> &#8212; your name and email come filled in; Autonomy replies by email with a new license. A copy nearing its end offers the same from its warning.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
